sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Streamlit Dashboard
    participant DB_C as Postgres (config)
    participant A as Airflow (Scheduler)
    participant M as Maintenance.py
    participant DB_D as Postgres (raw/clean)

    Note over U, DB_C: Phase 1: Configuration
    U->>UI: Set Retention Days (e.g., 60 days) & Toggle ON
    UI->>DB_C: UPDATE system_settings SET value=60, enabled=true
    DB_C-->>UI: Success
    UI-->>U: Settings saved

    Note over A, DB_D: Phase 2: Execution (Scheduled)
    A->>M: Trigger Maintenance Task
    M->>DB_C: GET system_settings (key, value, enabled)
    DB_C-->>M: Settings Data
    
    alt is_enabled == true
        M->>DB_D: DELETE FROM raw.listings WHERE scraped_at < X days
        M->>DB_D: UPDATE clean.listings SET is_active=FALSE WHERE last_seen < Y days
        DB_D-->>M: Records affected
        M-->>A: Task Finished Successfully
    else is_enabled == false
        M-->>A: Task Skipped (User Disabled)
    end